<title>POLAND: BFK Q4 net rises to PLN 3.5 mln.</title>
<headline>BFK Q4 net rises to PLN 3.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bydgoska Fabryka Kabli SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			12.66 vs    9.19</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  13.85 vs    5.56</p>
<p>    net profit				 3.50 vs    0.03</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bydgoska Fabryka Kabli SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 94.23 vs   89.47</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  63.07 vs   57.17</p>
<p>    extraordinary			    0.00 vs    0.09 loss</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax				10.34 vs    5.53</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     2.71 vs    3.52</p>
<p>    financial costs			  1.52 vs    7.07</p>
<p>    investment				10.73 vs    4.44</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit			53.67 vs   40.44</p>
